    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "You are a Guardian Protector of the Fool. All kinds of enemies, objects and adversities will be thrown in Fool's position. Don't let him die!<br>Protect Your Fool!<br><br>Dozens of levels with tons of unique enemies combinations awaits you in 4 different difficulties. Easy, Normal, Hardcore and Endless.<br>Explore amazing themes: Western, Medieval and Dino Park.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/759a2b4a2b6d86e120f0f8231735082e.poster.avif?t=1581541809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/759a2b4a2b6d86e120f0f8231735082e.webm?t=1581541809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/759a2b4a2b6d86e120f0f8231735082e.mp4?t=1581541809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FAST-PACED</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Protect Your Fool is a frenetic arcade game where you must destroy or interact with objects and enemies with the right weapon so they don't collide with the Fool.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There's a panel in the game showing info about each one of the enemies. Learn and memorize the enemies behavior and don't be caught off guard. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Get used to the game speed as you feel the difficulty gradually increasing till it reaches frenetic levels.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENHANCE YOUR SKILLS</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Practice and enhance you Mouse skills (Speed and Precision) and Keyboard (Timing) while you compete with your friends and the whole steam community for the highscore.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Keep track of your game progress with a sophisticated statistics system. Get to know how many times you won and lost and even your aim precision in percentage.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Perfect for playing completely focused and compete. But also great for playing in window mode while warm-up and preparing to play your favorite MOBA or FPS game.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPETITIVE WITH STEAM LEADERBOARDS</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Once you unlock the Endless Mode you can compete for the highscore and become a ranked guardian protector on Steam Leaderboards</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Invite your friends to compete against you for the highscore.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Keep track of the Leaderboards table inside the game, where it shows your rank, friends and top players ranks.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STEAM ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock up to 95 Steam achievements.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Advance through some Tier Achievements. Iron, Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum and Diamond.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/fbcc22b4733f5e9fe719b3a83fe286c2.poster.avif?t=1581541809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/fbcc22b4733f5e9fe719b3a83fe286c2.webm?t=1581541809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/fbcc22b4733f5e9fe719b3a83fe286c2.mp4?t=1581541809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW TO PLAY</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use keyboard inputs (1,2,3,4) or (Q,W,E,R) to select the right weapon. With the mouse, click the left mouse button on the incoming object/enemy to destroy it.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your weapons are: (1) Hands, (2) Blade, (3) Hammer, (4) Shotgun.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Keep the combo train going. Missed clicks on enemies and clicks with wrong weapon equipped, break the combo and reset the bonus score you get for each enemy destroyed.</li></ul><br>Come to compete for the highscore and Protect Your Fool as soon as possible! See you in the Leaderboards!<br><br><br><i>Warning: This game contains flashing images. It is advised that you do not play if you suffer from photosensitive epilepsy.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "You are a Guardian Protector of the Fool. All kinds of enemies, objects and adversities will be thrown in Fool's position. Don't let him die!<br>Protect Your Fool!<br><br>Dozens of levels with tons of unique enemies combinations awaits you in 4 different difficulties. Easy, Normal, Hardcore and Endless.<br>Explore amazing themes: Western, Medieval and Dino Park.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/759a2b4a2b6d86e120f0f8231735082e.poster.avif?t=1581541809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/759a2b4a2b6d86e120f0f8231735082e.webm?t=1581541809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/759a2b4a2b6d86e120f0f8231735082e.mp4?t=1581541809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FAST-PACED</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Protect Your Fool is a frenetic arcade game where you must destroy or interact with objects and enemies with the right weapon so they don't collide with the Fool.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There's a panel in the game showing info about each one of the enemies. Learn and memorize the enemies behavior and don't be caught off guard. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Get used to the game speed as you feel the difficulty gradually increasing till it reaches frenetic levels.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENHANCE YOUR SKILLS</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Practice and enhance you Mouse skills (Speed and Precision) and Keyboard (Timing) while you compete with your friends and the whole steam community for the highscore.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Keep track of your game progress with a sophisticated statistics system. Get to know how many times you won and lost and even your aim precision in percentage.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Perfect for playing completely focused and compete. But also great for playing in window mode while warm-up and preparing to play your favorite MOBA or FPS game.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPETITIVE WITH STEAM LEADERBOARDS</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Once you unlock the Endless Mode you can compete for the highscore and become a ranked guardian protector on Steam Leaderboards</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Invite your friends to compete against you for the highscore.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Keep track of the Leaderboards table inside the game, where it shows your rank, friends and top players ranks.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STEAM ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock up to 95 Steam achievements.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Advance through some Tier Achievements. Iron, Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum and Diamond.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/fbcc22b4733f5e9fe719b3a83fe286c2.poster.avif?t=1581541809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/fbcc22b4733f5e9fe719b3a83fe286c2.webm?t=1581541809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135480/extras/fbcc22b4733f5e9fe719b3a83fe286c2.mp4?t=1581541809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW TO PLAY</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use keyboard inputs (1,2,3,4) or (Q,W,E,R) to select the right weapon. With the mouse, click the left mouse button on the incoming object/enemy to destroy it.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your weapons are: (1) Hands, (2) Blade, (3) Hammer, (4) Shotgun.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Keep the combo train going. Missed clicks on enemies and clicks with wrong weapon equipped, break the combo and reset the bonus score you get for each enemy destroyed.</li></ul><br>Come to compete for the highscore and Protect Your Fool as soon as possible! See you in the Leaderboards!<br><br><br><i>Warning: This game contains flashing images. It is advised that you do not play if you suffer from photosensitive epilepsy.</i>",
